{{Quote|"In legends, Cetus the Tidebreaker guides drowned ships and sailors to the realm beyond. Yet they were fickle when they sang in sorrow and fury. Tempests raged, skies darkened, until Imperator enlightened them with lantern light making them a ruler of marine life and Guardian of the Sea."|Phoebe}}

'''Cetus the Tidebreaker''' is a [[Tacet Discord]] that lives in the deep waters of the Stormy Sea around [[Ragunna]]. It is closely associated with the [[Sentinel]] [[Imperator]] and serves as a steward of the souls lost at sea.

It was first introduced as a quest-exclusive [[NPC]] during the {{Quest|Through the Sea Thou Break}}.

==Descriptions==
{{Description|A colossal, whale-like Tacet Discord. Depite its gentle nature, its gargantuan size can inadvertently cause significant destruction.}}

